  "job_B1.4.16_20251001_193231": {
    "text": "Matheus se godspellere, \u00fee w\u00e6s mid Criste on life, and his lare gehyrde, on his hirede wuniende, he\nGe gehyrdon \u00fea bebodu \u00fee God bebead gefyrn \u00feam ealdan Israhele under Moyses lage, and hym \u00feus\nIc secge eow to so\u00f0an \u00fe\u00e6t se bi\u00f0 domes scyldig, se \u00f0e nu yrsa\u00f0 wi\u00f0 his agenne bro\u00f0or.\nSe \u00f0e him hosp gecwy\u00f0, se bi\u00f0 \u00feeahtes scyldig, and se \u00f0e hine h\u00e6t stuntne, se bi\u00f0 wites scyldig on \u00feam\nGif \u00f0u geoffrast Gode \u00e6nige lac \u00e6t his weofode, and \u00feu \u00feonne ge\u00feencst \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fein bro\u00f0or h\u00e6f\u00f0 sum \u00feing\n\u00deis godspel is nu ges\u00e6d sceortlice eow \u00feus; and we secga\u00f0 eow \u00fe\u00e6t sume men wendon \u00fe\u00e6t seo ealde \u00e6\nWe ne magon libban on \u00f0isum life nateshwon, \u00fe\u00e6t we ne agylton wi\u00f0 God and wi\u00f0 men on worde and\n\u00c6lce d\u00e6g we syngia\u00f0, and \u00e6lce d\u00e6g we sceolon urne H\u00e6lend gladian mid sumre godnysse, se \u00f0e \u00e6fre\nSe H\u00e6lend us s\u00e6de, swa swa ge gehyrdon \u00e6r, So\u00f0 ic eow secge, \u00fe\u00e6t ge sylfe ne becuma\u00f0 into heofonan\n\u00dea boceras syndon and \u00fea Sundorhalgan \u00fea ealdan witan, \u00fee w\u00e6ron gefyrn, under Moyses lage, swa\n\u00dea cidde hym se H\u00e6lend swi\u00f0e oftr\u00e6dlice, for \u00f0an \u00fee hy ne heoldon \u00fea halgan beboda swa swa God\n\u00dea s\u00e6de se H\u00e6lend, \u00fee geseah heora heortan, swi\u00f0e egeslice word, hym \u00feus cidende: Uos iustificatis\nHym w\u00e6s beboden, on heora gehealdsumnyssum on Moyses lage, \u00fe\u00e6t hy moston lufian heora agene\nHym w\u00e6s beboden \u00fe\u00e6t hy ne h\u00e6mdon unrihtlice wi\u00f0 o\u00fera manna wif; ac us s\u00e6de Crist \u00feus: Omnis qui\nWe secga\u00f0 swa\u00f0eah \u00fe\u00e6t si ea\u00f0re to betenne \u00fea yfelan ge\u00feohtas \u00feonne \u00fea yfelan d\u00e6da, gyf man \u00feone\nHy teo\u00f0odon heora wyrta, and wolice forleton \u00fea maran beboda \u00fee Moyses bebead on \u00fe\u00e6re halgan\nNu sceole we healdan swa \u00fea l\u00e6ssan beboda, \u00fe\u00e6t we \u00f0a maran eac mid weorcum gefyllan.\nHy t\u00e6hton mid wordum, swa swa hit awriten is, Godes lare mannum, and forleton \u00fea weorc; ac se bi\u00fe\nHym w\u00e6s behaten, gif hy heoldon Godes \u00e6, eor\u00f0lice w\u00e6stmas, and Crist witodlice behet \u00fe\u00e6t ece lif\nNu mote we habban maran rihtwisnysse, nu us synd behatene \u00fea heofonlican speda, \u00fe\u00e6t we moton\nGe gehyrdon \u00fea bebodu \u00fee God bebead gefyrn \u00feam ealdan Israhele under Moyses lage, and hym \u00feus\nIc secge eow to so\u00fean \u00fe\u00e6t se bi\u00f0 domes scyldig, se \u00f0e nu yrsa\u00f0 wi\u00f0 his agenne bro\u00f0or.\nOn \u00f0am dome man tosc\u00e6t hwilc his scyld w\u00e6re, and oft he bi\u00f0 unscyldig on \u00f0am dome get\u00e6ht, se \u00f0e\nTo \u00e6g\u00feer \u00fe\u00e6ra \u00feinga, \u00fe\u00e6t is yrre and mansliht, g\u00e6\u00f0 se rihta dom; ac hit bi\u00f0 swa\u00feeah leohtre on bote\nSe \u00fee his bre\u00feer hosp gecwy\u00f0, se bi\u00f0 \u00feeahtes scyldig.\nHer syndon nu twa \u00feing, \u00fe\u00e6t yrre and se hosp, and \u00fe\u00e6r g\u00e6\u00f0 ge\u00feeaht to \u00feam twam \u00feingum, \u00fe\u00e6t man\nAnd se \u00f0e hine h\u00e6t stuntne, se bi\u00f0 wites scyldig on \u00f0am witnigendlican fyre \u00fe\u00e6re toweardan worulde.\nHer syndon nu \u00fereo \u00feing, and for\u00feig mare wite: \u00fe\u00e6t yrre and se hosp, and eac teonr\u00e6den; and \u00feas \u00feing\nMicele maran gyltas man m\u00e6g gebetan her on \u00feisum life, and \u00feone H\u00e6lend gegladian, \u00fe\u00e6t he ne \u00feurfe\nGod cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00feurh his witegan \u00fe\u00e6t he wolde mildsian \u00e6lcum men \u00fee gecyr\u00f0 fram his synnum to him,\nLareowas sceolon l\u00e6ran and styran, and witan sceolon \u00fereagan \u00fea \u00f0wyran and \u00fea stuntan, \u00e6g\u00feer ge\nPaulus se Apostol on his pistole cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00feus: Argue, obsecra, increpa, in omni patientia et doctrina:\nGif hwa nu \u00feurh steore sum styrne word gecwy\u00f0 to his under\u00feeoddum for heora stuntnysse, ne bi\u00f0 na\nWe sceolon us gebletsian and abiddan \u00e6t Gode \u00feat he us gehealde, and urne mu\u00f0 \u00feurhhlynne, swa swa\nDuru he ab\u00e6d, \u00fe\u00e6t he fordyttan mihte \u00fea idelan spr\u00e6ca, and undon his mu\u00f0 to wisdomes spr\u00e6cum,\nVton nu gehyran \u00fe\u00e6s H\u00e6lendes l\u00e6cedom, hu we magon geh\u00e6lan her on \u00f0isum life ure yfelan word\nGif \u00f0u geoffrast Gode \u00e6nige lac \u00e6t his weofode, and \u00feu \u00feonne ge\u00f0encst \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fein bro\u00f0or h\u00e6f\u00f0 sum \u00f0ing\nSe H\u00e6lend cw\u00e6\u00f0 eft on sumere o\u00f0re stowe, \u00feonne ge sylfe standa\u00f0 on eowrum gebedum, forgifa\u00f0\n\u00deonne h\u00e6f\u00f0 ure bro\u00f0or sum \u00feing ongean us, gif we him deredon o\u00f0\u00f0e gedydon un\u00f0anc; \u00feonne sceole\nGif us \u00e6nig man dera\u00f0 o\u00f0\u00f0e gede\u00f0 un\u00feanc, \u00fe\u00e6t we sceolon forgifan, swa swa se H\u00e6lend s\u00e6de, \u00fe\u00e6t us\nVre lac syndon \u00fee we offria\u00f0 Gode ure halgan gebedu, and \u00fe\u00e6t we gehelpon \u00feam earmum mid urum\nBe \u00f0am sang se sealmwyrhta, \u00feus secgende him to: Adiutor meus, tibi sallam, et cetera;\u00fe\u00e6t is on\nHe het hine mildheortnys, for \u00f0an \u00fee he milde is, and he on manega wisan \u00feam mannum gehylp\u00f0 \u00fee\n\u00deam is wuldor and wur\u00f0mynt a to worulde, AMEN",
